[0.100, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[4A\u001b[0G[+] up 0/3\r\n \u001b[33m⠼\u001b[0m Container payment-orchestrator-kafka-1    Waiting                        \u001b[34m0.5s\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[33m⠼\u001b[0m Container payment-orchestrator-postgres-1 Waiting                        \u001b[34m0.5s\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[33m⠼\u001b[0m Container payment-orchestrator-redis-1    Waiting                        \u001b[34m0.5s\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[?25h"]
[0.072, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[4A\u001b[0G[+] up 3/3\r\n \u001b[32m✔\u001b[0m Container payment-orchestrator-kafka-1    \u001b[32mHealthy\u001b[0m                        \u001b[34m0.6s\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[32m✔\u001b[0m Container payment-orchestrator-postgres-1 \u001b[32mHealthy\u001b[0m                        \u001b[34m0.6s\u001b[0m\r\n \u001b[32m✔\u001b[0m Container payment-orchestrator-redis-1    \u001b[32mHealthy\u001b[0m                        \u001b[34m0.6s\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?25h"]
[0.063, "o", "\u001b[1m$ go run ./cmd/migrate up\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.771, "o", "migrations applied: version=6 dirty=false\r\n"]
[0.237, "o", "\u001b[2mstarting the provider simulator, the API, and a worker\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mthe worker uses the ASYNC provider: it answers 'pending', so the outcome\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2mcan only ever arrive as a webhook\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.528, "o", "\u001b[2mwaiting for services\u001b[0m"]
[0.029, "o", "."]
[1.024, "o", "."]
[1.038, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.023, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"dependencies\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"kafka\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"ok\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"postgres\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"ok\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"redis\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"ok\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m,\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"status\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"ok\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.015, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m══ 1. The caller never waits on a third party \u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.806, "o", "\u001b[2mPOST /v1/payments writes the transaction, its audit row, and the queue\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mmessage in ONE database transaction, then returns.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.050, "o", "  created 3029fdd1-e2a1-4ea3-8648-ff979addd4a9 in 43ms\r\n"]
[0.022, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m state on create → created\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m returned in 43ms (no provider in the request path)\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2mthe worker authorizes, the provider answers 'pending', and a signed webhook\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2mcarries the real outcome back\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.372, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m resolved by webhook → authorized\r\n"]
[0.019, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m provider charges → 1\r\n"]
[1.206, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m══ 2. One key, one payment \u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.808, "o", "\u001b[2mthe same key again — byte-identical replay, no second transaction\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.029, "o", "  Idempotency-Replayed: true\r\n"]
[0.010, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m replayed → 1\r\n"]
[0.361, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m transactions → 1\r\n\u001b[2mthe same key with a DIFFERENT amount — 409, not a silent replay that would\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2mdiscard the second payment\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.037, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m conflicting body → 409\r\n"]
[1.206, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m══ 3. The provider succeeds, then hides it — and we do not charge twice \u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.806, "o", "\u001b[2mforcing timeout_after_success: the charge IS recorded, then the connection\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mhangs. The caller is never told it worked. Retrying here charges twice;\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2massuming failure writes off money the customer actually paid.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[5.284, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m recovered → authorized\r\n"]
[0.027, "o", "  provider charges before 1, after 2\r\n  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m charges created → 1\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2mresolved by asking GetStatus, never by guessing:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.201, "o", "    created      payment created\r\n    authorizing  sending to provider\r\n    authorized   recovered after ambiguous failure\r\n"]
[1.237, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m══ 4. A decline is never retried \u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.805, "o", "\u001b[2mamount ending in 51 — the last two digits are the real ISO-8583 code, so\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mthis declines for insufficient funds\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.460, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m state → failed\r\n"]
[0.019, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m charges created → 0\r\n\u001b[2mrepeating a decline cannot change the issuer's answer, and it escalates\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mfraud controls — so the retry ladder is never entered\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.206, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m══ 5. Webhooks: duplicated, out of order, sometimes early \u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.805, "o", "\u001b[2mchaos preset, with the three webhook faults forced on so this act shows the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2msame thing every run rather than whatever the dice allow\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.667, "o", "\u001b[2mwaiting for the callbacks to land\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[9.344, "o", "\r\n  \u001b[1mwebhook outcomes\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.129, "o", "    applied     12\r\n    ignored     5\r\n    superseded  9\r\n"]
[0.043, "o", "\r\n  50 deliveries served 200, 24 duplicates absorbed\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m non-200 responses → 0\r\n"]
[0.131, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m chaos payments authorized → 12\r\n"]
[0.017, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m charges at the provider → 12\r\n"]
[0.124, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m transactions authorized twice → 0\r\n"]
[0.127, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m stale events caught by the sequence guard → 9\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2ma duplicate is the provider doing its job — every one is answered 200\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2ma stale event is recorded as superseded: never applied, never dropped\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.205, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m══ 6. Replaying the whole webhook log changes nothing \u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.807, "o", "\u001b[2ma log that quietly re-applies itself is worse than no log: it invites the\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mexact recovery procedure that corrupts state\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.198, "o", "\u001b[1m$ go run ./cmd/webhookctl replay\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.502, "o", "ID  REFERENCE  SEQ  RECORDED  REPLAY  NOTE\r\n\r\n26 events, 0 would change state\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "{\"time\":\"2026-08-12T10:10:04.591034+07:00\",\"level\":\"INFO\",\"msg\":\"replay clean\",\"events\":26}\r\n"]
[0.003, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m 26 stored events, none would re-apply\r\n"]
[1.205, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m══ 7. An unreachable provider never produces a failed payment \u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[0.805, "o", "\u001b[2mtaking the provider down entirely\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.022, "o", "\u001b[1;39m{\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m\"outage_until\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m:\u001b[0m\u001b[0;32m\"2026-08-12T10:10:31.62589+07:00\"\u001b[0m\u001b[1;39m\u001b[1;39m}\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[8.080, "o", "  state while the provider is down: authorizing\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[0m still authorizing, not failed\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2ma false 'authorized' is caught by reconciliation; a false 'failed' is a\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mcustomer charged with no record of it\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.001, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m══ Summary \u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[1.133, "o", "  authorized    14\r\n  authorizing   1\r\n  failed        1\r\n"]
[0.005, "o", "\r\n\u001b[32m\u001b[1m  every claim in this demo was asserted and held.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[2mstopping demo processes\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.044, "o", "\u001b[2mremoving this run's topics\u001b[0m\r\n"]
